pe":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"毅","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"zú","traditional":"足","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"执","pinyin":"zhí","traditional":"執","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"齐","pinyin":"qí","traditional":"齊","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"modern":"庄","pinyin":"zhuāng","traditional":"莊","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"中","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"zhèng","traditional":"正","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"zú","traditional":"足","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jìng","traditional":"敬","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"wén","traditional":"文","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"理","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"mì","traditional":"密","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"chá","traditional":"察","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"zú","traditional":"足","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"别","pinyin":"bié","traditional":"別","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Hanya seorang Nabi yang sempurna di dunia ini dapat terang pendengaran, jelas penglihatan, cerdas pikiran, dan bijaksana; maka cukuplah Ia menjadi pemimpin. Keluasan hatinya, kemurahannya, keramah-tamahannya dan kelemah lembutannya, cukup untuk meliputi segala sesuatu. Semangatnya yang berkobar-kobar, keperkasaannya, kekerasan hatinya dan ketahan ujiannya, cukup untuk mengemudikan pekerjaan besar. Kejujurannya, kemuliaannya, ke- Tengahannya dan kelurusannya cukup untuk menunjukkan kesungguhannya. Ketertibannya, keberesannya, ketelitiannya dan kewaspadaannya cukup untuk membedakan segala sesuatu."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.31.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"pǔ","traditional":"溥","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bó","traditional":"博","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"渊","pinyin":"yuān","traditional":"淵","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"quán","traditional":"泉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"时","pinyin":"shí","traditional":"時","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chū","traditional":"出","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Kebajikannya tersebar luas, dalam, tenang dan mengalir tiada henti-hentinya, ibarat air keluar dari sumbernya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.31.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"pǔ","traditional":"溥","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bó","traditional":"博","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"渊","pinyin":"yuān","traditional":"淵","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"quán","traditional":"泉","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"渊","pinyin":"yuān","traditional":"淵","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"见","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"見","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"莫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jìng","traditional":"敬","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"yán","traditional":"言","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"莫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìn","traditional":"信","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"xíng","traditional":"行","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mín","traditional":"民","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"莫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"说","pinyin":"shuō","traditional":"說","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Keluasannya sebagai langit, ketenangannya dalam bagai tanpa batas. Maka rakyat yang melihatnya tiada yang tidak menghormat. Rakyat yang mendengar kata-katanya tiada yang tidak menaruh percaya dan rakyat yang mengetahui perbuatannya tiada yang tidak bergembira."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.31.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"是","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"声","pinyin":"shēng","traditional":"聲","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"名","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yáng","traditional":"洋","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"溢","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"中","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"shī","traditional":"施","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jí","traditional":"及","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"蛮","pinyin":"mán","traditional":"蠻","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"貊","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"zhōu","traditional":"舟","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"车","pinyin":"chē","traditional":"車","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"力","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tōng","traditional":"通","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fù","traditional":"覆","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"de","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"载","pinyin":"zài","traditional":"載","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"rì","traditional":"日","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuè","traditional":"月","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhào","traditional":"照","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"shuāng","traditional":"霜","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lù","traditional":"露","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"队","pinyin":"duì","traditional":"隊","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"："},{"pinyin":"fán","traditional":"凡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xuè","traditional":"血","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"气","pinyin":"qì","traditional":"氣","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"莫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zūn","traditional":"尊","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"亲","pinyin":"qīn","traditional":"親","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，「"},{"pinyin":"pèi","traditional":"配","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"」。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maka gema namanya meluas meliputi Negeri Tengah, terberita hingga ke tempat bangsa Ban dan Bek, kemana saja perahu dan kereta dapat mencapai, tenaga manusia dapat menempuhnya; yang dinaungi langit, yang didukung bumi, yang disinari matahari dan bulan, yang ditimpa salju dan embun. Semua makhluk yang berdarah dan bernapas, tiada yang tidak menjunjung tinggi dan mencintainya. Maka dikatakan, telah manunggal Tuhan YME. TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XXXI (Sandaran Yang Teguh)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/31 - Bab XXX - Nabi Bagi Semua.md","title":"Bab XXX — Nabi Bagi Semua"}
